graph TB
    Start[Agent Spawn Request] --> Hook1[Before-Spawn Hook Triggered]
    Hook1 --> LoadSession[Load Session Memory Index]
    Hook1 --> LoadProject[Load Project Memory Index]
    Hook1 --> LoadUser[Load User Memory Index]

    LoadSession --> Filter[Filter by Brand/Persona]
    LoadProject --> Filter
    LoadUser --> Filter

    Filter --> Cache[Cache Filtered Memories]
    Cache --> Inject[Inject Memories into Agent Context]
    Inject --> Execute[Agent Executes Task]

    Execute --> Decision{New Memories Created?}
    Decision -->|No| Cleanup[Agent Cleanup]
    Decision -->|Yes| Hook2[After-Task Hook Triggered]

    Hook2 --> Classify[Classify Memory Layer]
    Classify --> SessionSave{Session-Only?}
    Classify --> ProjectSave{Project-Scoped?}
    Classify --> UserSave{User-Wide?}

    SessionSave -->|Yes| WriteSession[Write to .pHive/sessions/ID/memory/]
    ProjectSave -->|Yes| WriteProject[Write to .pHive/memory/]
    UserSave -->|Yes| WriteUser[Write to ~/.claude/memory/]

    WriteSession --> UpdateIndex1[Update MEMORY.md Index]
    WriteProject --> UpdateIndex2[Update MEMORY.md Index]
    WriteUser --> UpdateIndex3[Update MEMORY.md Index]

    UpdateIndex1 --> Cleanup
    UpdateIndex2 --> Cleanup
    UpdateIndex3 --> Cleanup

    Cleanup --> End[Agent Complete]

    style Start fill:#2a4a7c,stroke:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style End fill:#2a4a7c,stroke:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style Hook1 fill:#1a3a2a,stroke:#4a9e7f,color:#fff
    style Hook2 fill:#1a3a2a,stroke:#4a9e7f,color:#fff
    style Filter fill:#3a2a1a,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#fff
    style Execute fill:#2a1a3a,stroke:#a78bfa,color:#fff
